---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---
<section id="inicio" class="relative flex min-h-[640px] items-center overflow-hidden bg-navy pt-28 pb-24 lg:min-h-[720px] lg:pb-32">
  <!-- background photo -->
  <img
    src="/banner-hero.png"
    alt="Crianças da Escola Premium explorando um globo terrestre em sala de aula"
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[72%_center]"
    fetchpriority="high"
  />
  <!-- legibility scrim: strong on the left where the copy sits, clearing to the right over the kids -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-navy/70 lg:bg-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-navy via-navy/85 to-transparent lg:via-navy/70" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-24 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="u-container relative">
    <div class="max-w-xl text-white lg:max-w-2xl">
      <p class="u-eyebrow text-gold">
        <Icon name="star" class="h-4 w-4" /> Educação forte, formação para a vida
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.04] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Seu filho merece uma escola que prepara para a <span class="text-gold">vida.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg text-white/80">
        Muito mais do que ensinar conteúdos, desenvolvemos valores, autonomia, criatividade e
        fluência em inglês desde os primeiros anos.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="#sobre"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gold px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-navy shadow-float transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          Conheça a Escola
          <Icon name="arrow" class="h-4 w-4" />
        </a>
        <a
          href="#contato"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:bg-white/15"
        >
          Agendar Visita
          <Icon name="calendar" class="h-4 w-4" />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-9 flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="flex -space-x-3">
          {
            [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => (
              <span class={`h-9 w-9 rounded-full border-2 border-navy bg-gradient-to-br ${i % 2 ? "from-gold to-gold-600" : "from-royal-100 to-royal"}`} />
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/80">
          <span class="font-bold text-white">+2.500 famílias</span> confiam na Escola Premium
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- floating badge near the kids -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-28 right-6 hidden items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-float xl:flex">
    <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-royal-100 text-royal">
      <Icon name="globe" class="h-6 w-6" />
    </span>
    <div class="leading-tight">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-navy">Ensino Bilíngue</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate">Do berçário ao Fundamental I</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
